  "name": "Suppliers Compliance Monitor",
  "description": "Assesses supplier compliance across classification dimensions to help supplier qualification managers identify coverage gaps. This analyst extracts classification attributes from policy documents, evaluates supplier data against defined criteria, and computes qualification percentages by segment. It generates category-level visualizations to highlight trends and areas requiring attention.",
