            {
              "id": "1775733720494_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Input:\n{{$context.$nodes.EXTERNAL_MONITORING_SOURCES_POLICY_NODE.$output}}\n\nYou are given a JSON array of objects with the fields:\n- Purpose\n- ExternalSource\n\nFor each object:\n- Read the content from the URL or URLs in ExternalSource\n- Write a short alert summarizing the content in relation to the Purpose\n- Replace ExternalSource with that alert summary\n- Keep Purpose unchanged\n\nAlert style:\n- In one sentence, highlight the regulatory or standards change from the contexts displayed on the web pages given as URLs\n- Include:\n   * What and when is the change\n   * Effective timeframe\n   * Impacted supplier types\n- Use neutral, professional wording\n- Do not include raw URLs unless they are essential\n- Do not add opinions or speculation\n\nIf content is unavailable:\n- Set ExternalSource to Unable to retrieve source content.\n\nReturn only JSON and preserve the same array structure."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
